  "question": {
    "text": "A uniform cylinder of the radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is spin about its axis at an angular velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ω</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><msqrt><mi>π</mi></msqrt><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>rad</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> and placed between two perpendicular walls. The coefficient of friction between the walls and cylinder is <math><mi>μ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> Then, how many rotations will the&nbsp;cylinder make before it comes to rest?<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0081_ea3a7770a77b.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 91px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "50",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0081_3ac8102fdb1a.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 189px;\" /></p><p><math><mi>μ</mi><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>The torque about&nbsp;the center of mass of the cylinder is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>μ</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>μ</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>R</mi><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>μ</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>R</mi><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>μ</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math></p>"
